00:49:56.820 --> 00:50:05.300
And, you know, we would always have stunt coordinators come in anytime we had to put our hands on another actor, even if it was something that might be considered small,
而且，你知道，每当我们有肢体接触戏份时，即使是那种可能被认为很小的动作，我们都会请特技指导过来，

1017
00:50:05.300 --> 00:50:06.100
like a slap.
比如扇耳光。

1018
00:50:06.100 --> 00:50:17.540
And they actually teach you how to hit someone with your palm in this certain sort of cupped way so it makes a louder noise or it looks more violent than it really is.
他们会教你如何用手掌以某种特定的杯状方式击打对方，这样发出的声音会更大，或者看起来比实际更暴力。

1019
00:50:17.540 --> 00:50:22.320
And so, you know, we always had that training in us as well.
所以，你知道，我们一直都有接受那种训练。

