1540
01:16:17.680 --> 01:16:26.520
And then instead of, like, a wake where they come and view the body and you're in the casket, like, and you say your goodbye, you're on your surfboard.
然后，与其说是守灵，大家来看遗体，你躺在棺材里，然后大家跟你告别，不如说你就站在冲浪板上。

1541
01:16:26.520 --> 01:16:37.760
Well, if it were me, I guess I would be propped up maybe watching TV, eating a bowl of frozen yogurt or making bread.
嗯，如果是我的话，我想我大概会被摆成正在看电视，吃着一碗冷冻酸奶或者做面包的样子。

1542
01:16:38.520 --> 01:16:40.560
