So, yes, I guess your point was that perhaps Dwight's funeral, he would have been...
所以，是的，我想你的意思是德怀特的葬礼，他可能应该……

1552
01:17:20.220 --> 01:17:22.560
Staged at his Dunder Mifflin desk.
被布置在他的邓德·米夫林办公桌前。

1553
01:17:22.860 --> 01:17:23.460
Okay.
好吧。

1554
01:17:24.160 --> 01:17:25.340
