1555
01:17:26.300 --> 01:17:30.220
At the funeral home, there's even a lookbook that you can flip through.
在殡仪馆，甚至还有一本你可以翻阅的样册。

1556
01:17:30.500 --> 01:17:36.200
Oh, yeah, I'll take Exhibit A at the desk, typing on the keyboard, pose.
哦，对，我会选A展品，坐在桌前，敲着键盘，摆好姿势。

1557
01:17:37.040 --> 01:17:37.640
Wow.
