1585
01:19:00.900 --> 01:19:02.820
The big reveal at the funeral.
葬礼上的大揭秘。

1586
01:19:06.500 --> 01:19:06.900
Okay.
好吧。

1587
01:19:07.500 --> 01:19:08.060
Okay.
好吧。

1588
01:19:08.280 --> 01:19:08.480
Okay.
好吧。

1589
01:19:08.480 --> 01:19:13.100
So now, now we have this amazing, we have to get it together.
所以现在，现在我们有了这个绝妙的创意，我们得把它整合起来。

1590
01:19:13.800 --> 01:19:14.360
Okay.
好吧。

1591
01:19:15.180 --> 01:19:16.280
Oh, my God.
哦，天哪。

1592
01:19:16.800 --> 01:19:17.040
Okay.
好吧。

1593
01:19:17.260 --> 01:19:20.380
Now we have this amazing Andy talking head.
现在我们有了这段精彩的安迪访谈。

1594
01:19:20.520 --> 01:19:22.180
It's a Willy Wonka callback.
这是对《查理和巧克力工厂》的致敬。

1595
01:19:22.180 --> 01:19:22.840
It's awesome.
太棒了。

1596
01:19:23.120 --> 01:19:27.940
It goes a little something like, oompa loompa, dippity dosom.
大概是这样的，奥姆帕·罗姆帕，滴滴答答。

1597
01:19:28.360 --> 01:19:31.380
Dwight is now gone, which is totally awesome.
德怀特现在走了，这真是太棒了。

1598
01:19:31.940 --> 01:19:32.220
Yeah.
是啊。

1599
01:19:32.480 --> 01:19:34.820
I was like, who wrote this talking head?
我当时想，这段访谈是谁写的？

1600
01:19:35.060 --> 01:19:35.620
Who wrote?
是谁写的？

1601
01:19:35.700 --> 01:19:36.440
It's so good.
太棒了。

1602
01:19:37.360 --> 01:19:40.320
And in the DVD commentary, they said it was Mike Schur.
在DVD评论音轨里，他们说是迈克·舒尔想出来的。

1603
01:19:41.580 --> 01:19:42.880
Oh, there you go.
噢，原来如此。

1604
01:19:43.100 --> 01:19:43.360
Yeah.
没错。

1605
01:19:43.580 --> 01:19:46.640
Ed said that Mike was in the room with him when he was doing his
埃德说他录制访谈片段时，迈克就在房间里陪着他，

1606
01:19:46.640 --> 01:19:50.820
talking head and they were riffing around and they found this one.
他们当时在即兴发挥，然后就想到了这个点子。

1607
01:19:50.960 --> 01:19:52.380
And it's so, it's so perfect.
