1608
01:19:52.660 --> 01:19:58.000
And then, of course, Angela, in the background of this talking head, the camera finds you
当然，在这个访谈片段的背景里，摄像机还捕捉到了你，安吉拉，

1609
01:19:58.540 --> 01:20:02.200
hovering in the background, giving a death stare.
你在背景里徘徊，投来死亡凝视。

1610
01:20:02.200 --> 01:20:03.080
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

1611
01:20:03.880 --> 01:20:04.840
Death stare.
死亡凝视。

1612
01:20:05.160 --> 01:20:07.160
I remember this so vividly.
我对此记忆犹新。

1613
01:20:07.360 --> 01:20:10.420
So, Greg was like, Angela, I really want you to glare.
当时格雷格说，安吉拉，我真的需要你瞪人。

1614
01:20:10.680 --> 01:20:11.780
Like, really be angry.
就是那种，真的非常生气。

1615
01:20:11.920 --> 01:20:14.280
Just like, Andy is going down.
就像是，安迪要倒霉了。

1616
01:20:14.280 --> 01:20:15.060
You hate him.
你恨他。

1617
01:20:15.180 --> 01:20:15.800
Glare at him.
瞪着他。

1618
01:20:15.800 --> 01:20:16.940
So, I did.
于是我就照做了。

1619
01:20:17.240 --> 01:20:19.960
And he came up to me and he was like, can you give me more?
他走过来跟我说，能再多给点情绪吗？

1620
01:20:20.300 --> 01:20:21.200
I was like, what?
我说，什么？

1621
01:20:21.480 --> 01:20:22.800
He was like, even harder.
他说，再狠一点。

1622
01:20:22.940 --> 01:20:26.880
I want you to, I just need the death stare of all death stares.
我需要你展现出终极死亡凝视。

1623
01:20:27.180 --> 01:20:28.320
I did it again.
我又做了一次。

1624
01:20:28.320 --> 01:20:29.600
He's like, Angela, even more.
他说，安吉拉，还要更多。

1625
01:20:29.740 --> 01:20:31.460
I wrote about it in my journal.
我在日记里写过这件事。

1626
01:20:31.660 --> 01:20:36.240
I said, Greg kept saying, one more time, Angela, more mad, more.
我写道，格雷格一直说，再来一次，安吉拉，更生气点，再多点。

1627
01:20:36.240 --> 01:20:40.320
By the end, my eyeballs were shaking in my head.
到最后，我的眼球都在脑袋里打颤了。

1628
01:20:41.260 --> 01:20:44.200
I wrote down, Angela, did you get a headache?
我写下，安吉拉，你头疼了吗？

1629
01:20:45.480 --> 01:20:46.000
Yes.
是的。

1630
01:20:46.200 --> 01:20:47.680
I had the sci-fi bun.
我当时梳着那个科幻发髻。

1631
01:20:47.820 --> 01:20:49.500
I was giving the super death stare.
我正在施展超级死亡凝视。

1632
01:20:49.920 --> 01:20:54.620
And truly, by the end, I think you can ever so slightly see me shaking.
说真的，到最后，我觉得你甚至能隐约看到我在发抖。

1633
01:20:54.920 --> 01:20:57.700
That's how, like, angry my stare is.
我的凝视就是这么愤怒。

1634
01:20:57.780 --> 01:21:03.900
That I'm like, I was curious if you, like, popped a blood vessel in your eyeball or something.
我当时就在想，你是不是瞪到眼球血管爆裂了之类的。

1635
01:21:03.900 --> 01:21:05.380
It is so intense.
这太强烈了。

1636
01:21:06.240 --> 01:21:07.180
I was about to.
我差点就爆了。

1637
01:21:07.360 --> 01:21:08.060
I'm not kidding.
我没开玩笑。

1638
01:21:08.380 --> 01:21:10.980
It is a great way to end the episode.
这是结束这一集的绝佳方式。

1639
01:21:11.600 --> 01:21:14.100
I do have a fan question, Angela.
安吉拉，我有个粉丝提问。

1640
01:21:14.400 --> 01:21:14.780
Okay.
好的。

1641
01:21:14.960 --> 01:21:19.680
And I don't mean to unravel the entire plot of this show.
我不是想推翻整部剧的剧情。

1642
01:21:19.900 --> 01:21:20.360
What?
什么？

1643
01:21:20.500 --> 01:21:21.720
But it's a good question.
但这是一个好问题。

1644
01:21:21.980 --> 01:21:22.280
Okay.
好吧。

1645
01:21:22.740 --> 01:21:24.620
It comes from Grace D.
来自格蕾丝·D。

1646
01:21:25.500 --> 01:21:31.120
And she says, why couldn't Angela just bring her own tax forms to corporate?
她说，为什么安吉拉不能自己带税表去公司总部？

1647
01:21:31.440 --> 01:21:33.720
She has too many cats, Grace.
因为她养了太多猫了，格蕾丝。

1648
01:21:33.720 --> 01:21:41.040
Well, and also, we know from the deleted scene, one of her cats just had a litter of kittens that she's dealing with.
嗯，而且我们从删减片段里知道，她的一只猫刚生了一窝小猫，她正忙着照顾呢。

1649
01:21:41.220 --> 01:21:43.280
That was my first thought, too, Angela.
安吉拉，这也是我第一个想到的。

1650
01:21:43.480 --> 01:21:45.320
I was kind of stumped by that at firSt.
起初我也被这个问题难住了。

1651
01:21:45.380 --> 01:21:49.900
And I was like, yeah, why didn't Angela just go to New York herself?
我当时就在想，对啊，为什么安吉拉不自己去纽约呢？

1652
01:21:49.900 --> 01:21:59.480
But then I was like, no, she probably gets up very early and has, like, a 90-minute cat routine she has to do every morning.
但后来我又想，不行，她可能起得很早，每天早上还要花90分钟给猫做全套护理。

1653
01:21:59.660 --> 01:21:59.940
Yes.
没错。

1654
01:21:59.980 --> 01:22:05.180
Putting ointment on eyes and medicines and grooming, right?
要给猫抹眼药膏、喂药、梳毛，对吧？

1655
01:22:05.180 --> 01:22:05.900
Yes.
是的。

1656
01:22:06.260 --> 01:22:10.640
And getting the litter boxes ready for the day and setting out food for all of them.
